    <string name="app_description">Luca Download Manager is a general-purpose public download manager supporting multi-segment HTTP/HTTPS file downloads, publicly accessible audio and video streams (MP3, FLAC, M4A, OGG, MP4, HLS/DASH), archives, documents, and BitTorrent/Magnet transfers. Users are responsible for ensuring they have the legal right or permission to download any content. DRM-protected or restricted copyrighted sources are not supported.</string>
